			"date": "2024-09-23T18:58:27.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Curious why you went with Vercel? I’ve switched between Cloudflare Pages, Netlify and Vercel with my personal site and settled on Vercel. Mainly due to it just working and its built in insights and analytics tools.</p>",
