			"date": "2024-09-23T19:06:53.937Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.nz/@dvsk\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>dvsk</span></a></span> I have sites on all three of those providers right now. If I had to summarize in a toot I’d say Cloudflare is great for “unlimited” bandwidth but the UX of the admin panels of the other two are much nicer and easier to follow.</p>",
